@API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5165
@contentType = application/json

### Get all expenses
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/expenses
Accept: {{contentType}}

### Create new expense
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/expenses
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "description": "Lunch at restaurant",
  "amount": 25.50,
  "date": "2025-09-25T12:00:00Z"
}

### Update expense
PUT {{API_HostAddress}}/api/expenses/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "id": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000",
  "description": "Updated lunch expense",
  "amount": 28.00,
  "date": "2025-09-25T12:00:00Z"
}

### Delete expense
DELETE {{API_HostAddress}}/api/expenses/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000
